		{"id":"task-sensor","type":"text","text":"**Task_Sensor** (Core1, P3)\n50Hz 讀取 + 互補濾波\n開機零點校準 · I2C 自動復位","x":-1120,"y":-400,"width":280,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gpio","type":"text","text":"**回饋單元**(由 App 端 CMD 直控)\nGPIO25 目標區間 LED\nGPIO26 蜂鳴器(達標雙響/超限長鳴)","x":-1440,"y":-230,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"task-comm","type":"text","text":"**Task_Comm** (Core0, P1)\nBLE 廣播 · 10Hz 角度推播\nProfile / CMD 接收解譯","x":-1120,"y":-70,"width":280,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"task-led","type":"text","text":"**Task_LED** (Core1, P1)\n狀態指示燈 GPIO2\n(廣播/連線/錯誤/達標)","x":-1440,"y":-70,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fw-note","type":"text","text":"✅ v3 韌體(2026-07-04 重寫)\nconfig.h / imu.h 模組化\n斷線即靜音 · GOAL 旗標制 · dt 夾限\n判定在 App 端 (決策 D1)","x":-1440,"y":90,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"ble-tx","type":"text","text":"**Angle TX**(Notify @25Hz / 40ms)\n`T,S,K,TR,SR,KR` 或 `ERR:1`\nMTU 128","x":-710,"y":-240,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ble-rx","type":"text","text":"**Profile RX**(Write)\n`CMD:LED_ON/OFF · GOAL · ALARM_ON/OFF`\n(SYNC/Profile 未實作,指令不可帶換行)","x":-710,"y":40,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"renderer","type":"text","text":"**Renderer**(React)\nZustand 單一狀態源\nChart.js 折線 · SVG 骨架 · 進度環\nWeb Bluetooth 連線 · CSV 匯出","x":-260,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"preload","type":"text","text":"**Preload**(contextBridge)\n型別安全 `window.irms`\ncontextIsolation ON","x":-260,"y":-180,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"main","type":"text","text":"**Main Process**\n`select-bluetooth-device` 自動配對 IRMS_Device\n`ipcMain.handle`(Session/Data/Action)","x":-260,"y":0,"width":300,"height":130,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"db","type":"text","text":"**SQLite**(better-sqlite3,同步)\n存於 `userData` 目錄\n`custom_actions` / `sessions` / `sensor_data`\n外鍵 ON DELETE CASCADE","x":110,"y":0,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"6"}
	],
